tform. Don’t ignore AI, but use AI the way it’s meant to be used. If everyone follows the same approach, the field will remain open and everyone will end up crowded in the same place. Don’t waste your time and money.\n\nAI was created by humans, and the human mind is still the strongest when it comes to strategy and planning. AI is only a helping tool that makes work a little faster, but you should not rely on it completely.", "timestamp": 1781708821, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "freksawy_ai", "author_id": "67467230868", "id": "18222279754321176", "text": "Send this to Google @google", "timestamp": 1781464841, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "picxl2026", "author_id": "80425814278", "id": "17894209740480885", "text": "Give credits to this guy 👇\nClaiming his project on LinkedIn\nLink : \n\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/posts/jishnu-vinod-50704b217_motiongraphics-motiondesign-saas-activity-7470788453987901441-6L7V?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_ios&rcm=ACoAAC8pkZgBNod4Dg5BZlwUzdA1D2PSIXr8j_I", "timestamp": 1781430312, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "shadowsofwisdom", "author_id": "4185495213", "id": "18005801276747466", "text": "How much does something like this cost? I have a browser extension I am building and want a video like this.", "timestamp": 1781328614, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ajwad_378", "author_id": "74533719298", "id": "17964178844939561", "text": "sound ? where to get this sound? gng plzz tell", "timestamp": 1781241615, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "e.l.h.a.m.z.a", "author_id": "7963699144", "id": "18079479191239680", "text": "Sound effects pls🔥", "timestamp": 1781040445, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWeq9OwE3MM/", "webpage_url_basename": "DWeq9OwE3MM", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fldb2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/658426829_2229728534101495_568288002282275714_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucket